flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Setup Prerequisites]
    B --> C[Initialize SageMaker Session]
    C --> D[Deploy Llama3-8B-Instruct Model]
    D --> E[Test Inference]
    E --> F[Optional: Test Baseline Latency]
    F --> G[Register Scalable Target]
    G --> H[Configure Auto-Scaling Policy]
    
    H --> I{Configure Target Tracking}
    I -->|Set Parameters| I1[TargetValue: 5.0 ConcurrentRequests/Model]
    I -->|Set Metric Type| I2[SageMakerVariant\nConcurrentRequestsPerModel\nHighResolution]
    I -->|Set Cooldown| I3[ScaleIn/ScaleOut: 300s]
    
    I1 --> J[Create CloudWatch Alarms]
    I2 --> J
    I3 --> J
    
    J --> K[Generate Traffic with LLMPerf]
    K --> L[Monitor Scale-Out Events]
    L --> M[Capture Performance Metrics]
    M --> N[Monitor Scale-In Events]
    N --> O[Cleanup Resources]
    O --> P[End]
    
    subgraph "Auto-Scaling Process"
    Q[High Traffic] -->|Triggers| R[AlarmHigh State]
    R -->|When ConcurrentRequests > 5| S[Scale-Out Action]
    S -->|Increases| T[Instance Count]
    
    U[Low Traffic] -->|Triggers| V[AlarmLow State]
    V -->|When ConcurrentRequests < 4.5\nfor 15 minutes| W[Scale-In Action]
    W -->|Decreases| T
    end